"在烈火纪，人们建造巨型傀儡阿塔玛森的唯一目的，就是阻止兽人首领吞噬者加库尔。加库尔仅凭一己之力便摧毁了这尊傀儡，随后又屠戮了一支数千人的军队，最终这名如恶魔般的战士才被杀死。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"092568698d43d2da2d5a0325fdefa6c0434bb153c778a440d4616ee370fc67c1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"50a53ca1da163192a7e7addd5fdd7a58a09ecbb4c42ba6ce57092bf590d2e788","logical_entry_identity":"d5aab241ea55eb15818b52e8a69889387ae250b8b6cc213b1853ebdfec0f5b7a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"These gloves make you feel rock steady! These magical gloves feel really soft to the touch from the inside. On the outside, magical stones create a rough surface that is constantly shifting. When you brace yourself, a magical ray of earth energy seems to automatically bind them to the ground, granting you increased stability.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这副手套令你感觉稳如磐石！这副魔法手套的内侧触感极其柔软，外侧则由不断变动的魔法石构成粗糙表面。当你稳住身体时，一道大地能量形成的魔法射线似乎会自动将它们固定在地面上，让你站得更稳。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b922c81545b983a3e61336b72e894b33673283a1ecf345439cfce48206047a89","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ca280a02ddf67f98db8fa36af8b2d5297bd0860e6dba9b5a108287523af50f57","logical_entry_identity":"5738ce52331c489b24836b9bd8738bb73ed5b8318ea8ae160643aa68da39c4c5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"For %d turn(s), you have 100%% chance that your summons appear as a wild version.\n\t\tEach turn the chance disminishes.\n\t\tWild creatures have one more talent/power than the base versions:\n\t\t- Ritch Flamespitter: Can fly in the air, spitting its Flamespit past creatures in the path of its target\n\t\t- Hydra: Can concentrate its breath into spits when allies would be caught in a breath, instead spitting a bolt\n\t\t- Rimebark: Can grab foes, pulling them into range of its ice storm\n\t\t- Fire Drake: Can emit a powerful roar to silence its foes\n\t\t- War Hound: Can rage, inreasing its critical chance and gaining armour penetration\n\t\t- Jelly: Can split into an additional jelly upon taking a large hit (jellies formed by splitting do not count against your summon cap)\n\t\t- Minotaur: Can rush toward its target\n\t\t- Stone Golem: Can disarm its foes\n\t\t- Turtle: Can force all foes in a radius into melee range\n\t\t- Spider: Can project an insidious poison at its foes, reducing their healing\n\t\tThis talent requires Master Summoner to be active to be used.\n\t\tEffects scale with levels in summon talents.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在 %d 回合内，你的召唤兽出现时有 100%% 几率成为野性版本。\n\t\t此概率每回合递减。\n\t\t野性生物比基础版本多一个天赋或能力：\n\t\t- 喷火里奇：可以在空中飞行，并越过目标路径上的生物喷射火焰\n\t\t- 三头蛇：吐息会波及友军时，可将吐息凝聚成弹体，改为喷出一道飞弹\n\t\t- 雾凇：可以抓取敌人，将它们拉进自己的冰风暴范围\n\t\t- 火龙：可以发出强力怒吼，使敌人沉默\n\t\t- 战争猎犬：可以狂暴，提高暴击率并获得护甲穿透\n\t\t- 果冻怪：受到一次重击时，可以分裂出另一个果冻怪（分裂出的果冻怪不会占用你的召唤物上限）\n\t\t- 米诺陶：可以向目标冲锋\n\t\t- 岩石傀儡：可以缴械敌人\n\t\t- 乌龟：可以迫使半径内所有敌人进入近战范围\n\t\t- 蜘蛛：可以向敌人喷射阴险的毒液，降低其治疗效果\n\t\t使用此天赋需要召唤精通处于激活状态。\n\t\t效果随召唤天赋等级提升。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1e4d02b3c33350d053108fc8c29ac255d1fda5961331883a60b06ac81671ffcf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"dec206c5dd83d07357cda8f0c4085bd7f9640479f0ad21613e7ab8d91e12a973","logical_entry_identity":"3e8be8b56c40f72efbee4f5bde477e1b503f4302fe39303335dad0f20608567d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Enter a blood frenzy, draining stamina quickly (-2 stamina/turn). Each time you kill a foe while in the blood frenzy, you gain a cumulative bonus to Physical Power of %d.\n\t\tEach turn, this bonus decreases by 2.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"进入血之狂暴状态，每回合迅速消耗 2 点体力。血之狂暴期间，每杀死一个敌人，你便获得可叠加的 %d 点物理强度加成。\n\t\t每回合该加成减少 2 点。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f5b79495b565f76e7c2666885a0cbb92a86837714f7219eb9b990d8c5f749ff4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"dec404af164a234e440dab3615abef7553545bd95ab7915657a51101ce88e71f","logical_entry_identity":"17589ad4e3f979594a5c2d7f6275978f249b5b9ffb07ced130cdf0f3a94d37a8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#F53CBE#%s struggles against the beckoning.","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#F53CBE#%s挣扎着抵抗召唤。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0f35394fed