bf187a1f2e54241eff9b371cbcdb0d753fe7f40c7534d827878af4b4","logical_entry_identity":"81542f46919af18c2d8d797b2aa8d9192648d030f650783e707aa1a009ac9de1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"While this ability is active, you will continually call up to %d level %d shadows to aid you in battle. Each shadow costs 5 hate to summon. Shadows are weak combatants that can: Use Arcane Reconstruction to heal themselves (level %d), Blindside their opponents (level %d), and Phase Door from place to place.\n\t\tShadows ignore %d%% of the damage dealt to them by their master.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当此技能激活时，你可以召唤 %d 个等级 %d 的阴影帮助你战斗。每个阴影需消耗 5 点仇恨值召唤。\n\t\t阴影是脆弱的战士，它们能够：使用奥术重组治疗自己（等级 %d），使用闪电突袭攻击敌人（等级 %d），使用相位之门进行传送。\n\t\t阴影无视主人对它们造成的 %d%% 伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2228aeb87769b6f14b1a3b93108a12364da3c902b526d503d6fdb14807060216","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"df8f90fcc6bd3bb353e12073b7ea6dd0e79925ab3e041fae5561798abf06aa54","logical_entry_identity":"6c2908ffc6e91c70c9c5979fe583441d2729fbae3a6168d558747f39eb764514","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is in the middle of a combo chain and has earned %d combo points.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标正在连击中，并获得了 %d 连击点数。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"79aff5a07b8ad56fdc65a1a6d59e04f79001280a0e1fbf9cf3a7f418e1167b26","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"df9e93cab7babf0400f2a0f408910cacfb7f0ea42381fa26953f2d50f3334fa0","logical_entry_identity":"bc8d6f46d9984c99198d8a3d70f08ba21f871fbabc578b2aa21b6cffc4f76fe4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Spit a cloud of flames, doing %0.2f fire damage in a radius of %d each turn for %d turns.\n\t\tThe flames will ignore the caster, and will drain 10%% of the damage dealt as the flames consume enemies life force and transfer it to the user.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Mindpower, and can critical.\n\t\tEach point in fire drake talents also increases your fire resistance by 1%%.","source_tag":"tformat","